    {
      "persona": "Universal Persona Content",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Dr. Mira Sen:</b> Asterlink launches night-service ticketing in a few hours. We have authorization for a narrow scan window, not a license to wander. ECHO-73 appears in the handoff notes as a host and a label, but we do not yet know its role.\n\nBuild an accurate map so operations can act before launch.",
      "taskInstructions": "",
      "taskQuestion": "",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Dr. Mira Sen:</b> Start with the authorization. It defines what we can examine and when we must stop."
    }
  ],
